# Mínimo de 32 caracteres. Usada para selar a sessão no servidor.
# Local Nuxt / .env — at least 32 characters.
# The Android app loads https://ms.bbksoftai.workers.dev, so Cloudflare must also
# have the same secret: Worker → Settings → Variables → NUXT_SESSION_PASSWORD.
NUXT_SESSION_PASSWORD=change-this-to-a-long-random-string-please
